flowchart TB
accTitle: Tag compliance and billing are separate controls
accDescr: Existing resources are repaired, future create requests are blocked when required tags are absent, and Billing activation makes applied tag keys available for cost allocation.
E[Existing RDS and DynamoDB resources]:::inputData --> T[Apply CostCenter and ProjectID]:::process
N[New creation request]:::inputData --> C{Both required tags present?}:::decision
C -->|No| X[SCP denies request]:::error
C -->|Yes and IAM permits| R[Create tagged resource]:::process
T --> B[Activate tag keys in Billing]:::process
R --> B
B --> O[Costs grouped by tag values]:::output
D[SCP blocks required-tag removal]:::reference -.-> R
